{"id":"c84f27165609eabd","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-recursive-functions-eff.md","title":"thm-recursive-functions-eff","display":"thm-recursive-functions-eff","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-thm-recursive-functions-eff","aliases":["16-thm-recursive-functions-eff","16-recursive-functions-eff"],"display":"thm-recursive-functions-eff","depends_on":["[[16-prop-nno-eff]]","[[16-df-kleene-numbering]]","[[16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff]]"],"source":"Theorem6.4.2 p.400 (PDF420)","revision_date":"2026-10-19"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-recursive-functions-eff"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-recursive-functions-eff</span><span>16-recursive-functions-eff</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-recursive-functions-eff"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c7c40f40c78440c0\" href=\"?note=c7c40f40c78440c0\" title=\"16-prop-nno-eff\">16-prop-nno-eff</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e3665c73100cecbb\" href=\"?note=e3665c73100cecbb\" title=\"16-df-kleene-numbering\">16-df-kleene-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"198e3b21cd4c6cd2\" href=\"?note=198e3b21cd4c6cd2\" title=\"16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff\">16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Theorem6.4.2 p.400 (PDF420)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-19"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf N=F(\\mathbb N,n\\mapsto\\{n\\})\">\\(\\mathbf N=F(\\mathbb N,n\\mapsto\\{n\\})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}\\to\\mathbf{Eff}\">\\(F:\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}\\to\\mathbf{Eff}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"198e3b21cd4c6cd2\" href=\"?note=198e3b21cd4c6cd2\" title=\"16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff\">16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff</a>，等同于 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c7c40f40c78440c0\" href=\"?note=c7c40f40c78440c0\" title=\"16-prop-nno-eff\">16-prop-nno-eff</a> 的二元PER对象。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_e\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e3665c73100cecbb\" href=\"?note=e3665c73100cecbb\" title=\"16-df-kleene-numbering\">16-df-kleene-numbering</a> 已固定的同一可接受编号。</li>\n<li>下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{TotRec}\\)</span> 由定义式构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\mapsto Ff\">\\(f\\mapsto Ff\\)</span> 是assembly嵌入作用于底层函数的Hom映射。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotRec}(\\mathbb N,\\mathbb N)\\coloneqq\\{f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\mid\n(\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N)(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N)\\ \\varphi_e(n)\\downarrow\\land\\varphi_e(n)=f(n)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TotRec}(\\mathbb N,\\mathbb N)\\coloneqq\\{f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\mid\n(\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N)(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N)\\ \\varphi_e(n)\\downarrow\\land\\varphi_e(n)=f(n)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{\\langle f,Ff\\rangle\\mid f\\in\\mathrm{TotRec}(\\mathbb N,\\mathbb N)\\}:\n\\mathrm{TotRec}(\\mathbb N,\\mathbb N)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathbf{Eff}(\\mathbf N,\\mathbf N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{\\langle f,Ff\\rangle\\mid f\\in\\mathrm{TotRec}(\\mathbb N,\\mathbb N)\\}:\n\\mathrm{TotRec}(\\mathbb N,\\mathbb N)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathbf{Eff}(\\mathbf N,\\mathbf N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Theorem6.4.2 p.400 (PDF420)。嵌入F满忠实，故Eff的自态射恰对应该assembly的可实现函数。跟踪条件在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E(n)=\\{n\\}\">\\(E(n)=\\{n\\}\\)</span> 上恰是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\cdot n=f(n)\">\\(e\\cdot n=f(n)\\)</span> 且对每个n有定义。不同程序索引计算相同函数则对应同一态射；本页没有声称所有内部广义函数都带一个外部固定全局索引。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-prop-nno-eff","status":"resolved","id":"c7c40f40c78440c0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-prop-nno-eff]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-kleene-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"e3665c73100cecbb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-kleene-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff","status":"resolved","id":"198e3b21cd4c6cd2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff","status":"resolved","id":"198e3b21cd4c6cd2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf N=F(\\mathbb N,n\\mapsto\\{n\\})$、$F:\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}\\to\\mathbf{Eff}$ 使用 [[16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff]]，等同于 [[16-prop-nno-eff]] 的二元PER对象。$\\varphi_e$ 为 [[16-df-kleene-numbering]] 已固定的同一可接受编号。","embed":false},{"target":"16-prop-nno-eff","status":"resolved","id":"c7c40f40c78440c0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf N=F(\\mathbb N,n\\mapsto\\{n\\})$、$F:\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}\\to\\mathbf{Eff}$ 使用 [[16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff]]，等同于 [[16-prop-nno-eff]] 的二元PER对象。$\\varphi_e$ 为 [[16-df-kleene-numbering]] 已固定的同一可接受编号。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-kleene-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"e3665c73100cecbb","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf N=F(\\mathbb N,n\\mapsto\\{n\\})$、$F:\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}\\to\\mathbf{Eff}$ 使用 [[16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff]]，等同于 [[16-prop-nno-eff]] 的二元PER对象。$\\varphi_e$ 为 [[16-df-kleene-numbering]] 已固定的同一可接受编号。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf N=F(\\mathbb N,n\\mapsto\\{n\\})","display":false},{"tex":"F:\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}\\to\\mathbf{Eff}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TotRec}","display":false},{"tex":"f\\mapsto Ff","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TotRec}(\\mathbb N,\\mathbb N)\\coloneqq\\{f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\mid\n(\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N)(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N)\\ \\varphi_e(n)\\downarrow\\land\\varphi_e(n)=f(n)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\{\\langle f,Ff\\rangle\\mid f\\in\\mathrm{TotRec}(\\mathbb N,\\mathbb N)\\}:\n\\mathrm{TotRec}(\\mathbb N,\\mathbb N)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathbf{Eff}(\\mathbf N,\\mathbf N).","display":true},{"tex":"E(n)=\\{n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"e\\cdot n=f(n)","display":false}],"bytes":1543,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-444","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-thm-recursive-functions-eff|thm-recursive-functions-eff]]"},{"id":"ceedfad83419f702","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TotRec}(\\mathbb N,\\mathbb N)$ 取 [[16-thm-recursive-functions-eff]] 的明确全递归函数集合。"}],"outgoing":["c7c40f40c78440c0","e3665c73100cecbb","198e3b21cd4c6cd2"]}